The adapter is not affiliated with Apple. It uses private ReminderKit APIs for
native Urgent state and subtask hierarchy only. It never edits Apple's databases.
Missing APIs or failed native readback stop the operation; uncertain saves require
review. macOS updates may change or remove these APIs.
